# property fail.
run fv-tlc CdcSnapshotHandoff.tla CorrectOffset.cfg WitnessCaughtUp.cfg
properties ExactlyOnce EventuallyCaughtUp
file CdcSnapshotHandoff.tla

mutation the snapshot notes one change before the true boundary
detects ExactlyOnce
-     /\ snapshotTaken' = TRUE /\ noted' = 2
+     /\ snapshotTaken' = TRUE /\ noted' = 1

mutation streaming stays possible but nothing ever requires it to happen
detects EventuallyCaughtUp
- Work == TakeSnapshotCorrect \/ (\E n \in 1..3 : TakeSnapshotWrong(n)) \/ StreamNext
- Next == Work \/ Done
+ Work == TakeSnapshotCorrect \/ (\E n \in 1..3 : TakeSnapshotWrong(n))
+ Next == Work \/ StreamNext \/ Done

harmless a comment on the snapshot action
